"transakce na kartě &quot;Spravovat&quot; a zkusit znovu zpracovat transakci"

msgid ""
"If you cannot find the extensions you are looking for in the admin area, "
"please visit the extension directory at <a href=\"https://extensions."
"fossbilling.org\" target=\"_blank\">https://extensions.fossbilling.org</a>."
